      "meaning": {
        "en": "Him from whom every stain is gone, the spotless",
        "hi": "उन्हें, जिनमें कोई दाग नहीं, निर्मल"
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "nir 'without' + añjana 'paint, black eye-paint': the one with no paint or stain on Him.",
